cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "wickra-timemachine"
abstract: >-
  Deterministic market replay built on the Wickra core: a recorded universe of
  order-book, trade and funding events is re-folded to any past timestamp, so
  the full microstructure state of every symbol at that instant -- book, tape,
  footprint, funding and streaming indicators -- is reconstructed rather than
  interpolated, byte-identically on every run and in every binding. Exposed as
  a JSON-over-C-ABI data API in ten languages.
type: software
authors:
